  "html": "<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:202px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Bagoyum.jpg\" title=\"Bag o' Yummy Yums\"><img alt=\"Bag o' Yummy Yums\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"171\" src=\"/images/Bagoyum.jpg\" width=\"200\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Bagoyum.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Bag o' Yummy Yums</div></div></div>\n<div class=\"thumb tright\"><div class=\"thumbinner\" style=\"width:136px;\"><a class=\"image\" href=\"/images/Yyyy.jpg\" title=\"Four types of Yummy Yums\"><img alt=\"Four types of Yummy Yums\" border=\"0\" class=\"thumbimage\" height=\"113\" src=\"/images/Yyyy.jpg\" width=\"134\"/></a> <div class=\"thumbcaption\"><div class=\"magnify\" style=\"float:right\"><a class=\"internal\" href=\"/images/Yyyy.jpg\" title=\"Enlarge\"><img alt=\"\" height=\"11\" src=\"/thetownstons/skins/common/images/magnify-clip.png\" width=\"15\"/></a></div>Four types of Yummy Yums</div></div></div>\n<p>The <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Candy Vaults</a> found off the <a href=\"/wiki/Mutanous_Malaise\" title=\"Mutanous Malaise\">Mutanous Malaise</a> offs, contain an number of Bags o' Yummy Yums.  Hitting a bag will cause it to burst open and release a number of <a href=\"/wiki/Yummy_Yum\" title=\"Yummy Yum\">Yummy Yums</a>, who will drop candy when defeated.  The candies are quest objects.  While you are fighting one group of Yummy Yums, be careful not to hit another bag with a weapon or a spell (such as Shadow Lightining) or you may be fighting several groups at one time.\n</p>\n\n \n<div class=\"visualClear\"></div>"
